msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/examples.rst:174
msgid "``--index-strategy unsafe-best-match``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/examples.rst:177
msgid ""
"pipx translates a ``pip`` option recorded as an abbreviation ``pip`` "
"accepts, such as ``--index-u``, like its full spelling. When a recorded "
"index option has no equivalent, such as a `uv <https://docs.astral.sh/uv/>`_ "
"``--index-strategy`` other than ``unsafe-best-match``, an ``--allow-insecure-"
"host`` URL, or ``pip``'s ``--keyring-provider import``, pipx refuses to "
"install that environment rather than fall back to ``PyPI``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/examples.rst:182
msgid ""
"``pip`` searches every index for the best version, while ``uv`` stops at the "
"first index that has the package, so a ``uv`` ``--index`` moved to ``pip`` "
"can pick a newer release from ``PyPI``. Pass ``--pip-args`` to replace the "
"recorded options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/examples.rst:186
msgid ""
"pipx skips the recorded interpreter, says why, and uses the default Python "
"when that interpreter is gone, sits inside a virtual environment, or, on "
"Unix, can be changed by another account through the file or a directory "
"above it. Pass ``--python`` to pick one yourself."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/examples.rst:190
msgid ""
"Up to eight environments install at once, with their output printed in "
"snapshot order:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/examples.rst:192
msgid ""
"$ pipx install-all pipx.json\n"
"'black' (24.3.0) is already installed. Not\n"
"modifying existing installation in '/home/user/.local/share/pipx/venvs/"
"black'.\n"
"Pass '--force' to force installation, or use\n"
"'pipx upgrade black' to upgrade.\n"
"'pipx' (1.4.3) is already installed. Not\n"
"modifying existing installation in '/home/user/.local/share/pipx/venvs/"
"pipx'.\n"
"Pass '--force' to force installation, or use\n"
"'pipx upgrade pipx' to upgrade.\n"
"$ pipx install-all pipx.json --force\n"
"Installing to existing venv 'black'\n"
"  installed package black 24.3.0, installed using Python 3.12.0\n"
"  These apps are now available\n"
"    - black\n"
"    - blackd\n"
"Installing to existing venv 'pipx'\n"
"  installed package pipx 1.4.3, installed using Python 3.12.0\n"
"  These apps are now available\n"
"    - pipx"
msgstr ""

